    <briefdescription>
<para><ref refid="class_statistics" kindref="compound">Statistics</ref> of weighted values. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The object holds sorted values. Each value has a count. A list of samples gives a count of 1 for each sample. The bins of a profiler give the bin centre, in ns, with the bin count. Each getter reads the sorted values and the counts. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
